					"nextDialogs": [
						413341203
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 413341203,
					"content": "昨天…根本沒多少客人過來啊，這是怎麼回事，這大過節的，客人不是應該很多嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413341204,
						413341205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "朱老闆"
				},
				{
					"id": 413341204,
					"content": "沒多少人會經過這裡吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413341206
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 413341206,
					"content": "不可能啊，這怎麼可能…不對，一定是我招攬客人的手法錯了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413341207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "朱老闆"
				},
				{
					"id": 413341207,
					"content": "要是直接去招攬客人，會不會效果好一些…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413341208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "朱老闆"
				},
				{
					"id": 413341208,
					"content": "#旅行者，{F#妳}{M#你}能再幫我去周圍招攬一下客人嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413341209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "朱老闆"
				},
				{
					"id": 413341209,
					"content": "就說…我這有好菜和好環境，很適合在海燈節期間觀景。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413341210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "朱老闆"
				},
				{
					"id": 413341210,
					"content": "我也再想想有什麼能招攬客人的方式…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "朱老闆"
				},
				{
					"id": 413341205,
					"content": "海燈節期間外出的人很少吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
